# Context surfaces

When scoring file candidates, use these exclusive surfaces:

- `src/tools`, `src/server.ts`, `src/workflows` — MCP tools, schemas, client instructions
- `src/bridge`, `cep-plugin` — production CEP / ExtendScript
- `uxp-plugin`, `src/tools/uxp*` — preview UXP only; no silent CEP fallback
- `landing` — marketing site; generated facts, not source tool counts
- `docs/claims-registry.*`, `landing/lib/published-release.json` — public claims
- `plugins/**/SKILL.md`, `claude-plugins/**/SKILL.md` — keep both copies identical
